nsors tracking</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"980\">\r\n<p data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"980\">Chroma RGB-verlichting</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"1015\">\r\n<p data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1015\">Comfortabel voor lange sessies</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1050\">✨ <strong data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1048\">Razer Firefly RGB Muispad</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1194\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1105\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1105\">Hard oppervlak voor snelle, consistente bewegingen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1147\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1147\">Chroma-verlichting langs de hele rand</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1194\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1194\">Perfecte combinatie met Razer-gamingmuizen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1199\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1230\">💶 Nieuwprijs indicatie</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1301\">💡 <strong data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1301\">De gemiddelde totaal nieuwprijs van deze set ligt rond de €350.</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1306\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1331\">🎁 Staat & levering</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1429\">✔️ Alles functioneert perfect<br data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1364\">✔️ Complete set<br data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1382\">✔️ Ideaal voor gaming, streaming en thuisstudio</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1434\">\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1436\" data-end=\"1531\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Een <strong data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1464\">premium Razer-bundel</strong> voor wie direct professioneel aan de slag wil. Klaar voor gebruik!</p>",
